{{!
    @template tool_vae/selfpos_disclaimer

    The two sentences every screen of the self-positioning carries: what is written here is visible to the manager who
    follows, and it is not a validation.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\selfpos_disclaimer. The template holds no logic.
    Every value is escaped (double braces): none of them is HTML.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * text - string, the two sentences

    Example context (json):
    {
        "text": "What you write here is visible to the managers who follow you. This is not a validation."
    }
}}
<p class="text-muted small tool-vae-selfpos-disclaimer">{{text}}</p>
